Is hisse ka plan (aage teen sabaq hain):
2.2.1 ek line aur coordinate axes: line \(x\)-axis aur \(y\)-axis ko kahan kaat'ti hai;
2.2.2 do lines: yeh zyada se zyada ek point par milti hain;
2.2.3 ek line aur ek parabola: do, ek ya koi bhi point nahin.
Har case mein idea ek hi hai: jo point dono graphs par hai, us ka \(x\) bhi dono ke liye same hai aur \(y\) bhi same hai.
